#: ../../source/translation.rst:2
msgid "Help translate Diátaxis"
msgstr "帮助翻译 Diátaxis"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:4
msgid ""
"If you'd like to help translate Diátaxis into your language, that would "
"be very welcome."
msgstr "如果愿意帮助将 Diátaxis 翻译成你的语言，我们非常欢迎。"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:10
msgid ""
"As soon as a translation is complete, I will publish it on "
"https://diataxis.fr."
msgstr "翻译一完成，我就会将其发布到 https://diataxis.fr。"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:14
msgid "Translation guide"
msgstr "翻译指南"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:17
msgid ""
"The best way to contribute to translation is via `Transifex "
"<https://transifex.com>`_, where you'll need an account."
msgstr "参与翻译的最佳方式是使用 `Transifex <https://transifex.com>`_，你需要在该平台拥有账号。"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:21
msgid "Joining a language team"
msgstr "加入语言团队"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:23
msgid ""
"Go to the `Diátaxis page on Transifex "
"<https://explore.transifex.com/danieleprocida/diataxis/>`_, and select "
"`Join this project "
"<https://app.transifex.com/join/?o=danieleprocida&p=diataxis&t=opensource>`_."
msgstr ""
"前往 `Transifex 上的 Diátaxis 页面 <https://explore.transifex.com/danieleprocida/diataxis/>`_，"
"并选择 `加入此项目 <https://app.transifex.com/join/?o=danieleprocida&p=diataxis&t=opensource>`_。"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:25
msgid ""
"There you'll find the option to join the translation team for the "
"language you're interested in. After that I will receive notification of "
"your join request, and will add you to the team. Your own `Transifex "
"dashboard <https://app.transifex.com/home/>`_ will remain blank until I "
"do."
msgstr ""
"在那里可以选择加入所感兴趣语言的翻译团队。之后我会收到你的加入请求通知，并将你"
"加入团队。在此之前，你自己的 `Transifex 控制面板 <https://app.transifex.com/home/>`_ 会保持空白。"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:27
msgid ""
"By all means email me to let me know, because the Transifex notifications"
" don't come in immediately."
msgstr "也欢迎给我发邮件告知，因为 Transifex 的通知不会立即送达。"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:31
msgid "Translating"
msgstr "翻译"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:33
msgid ""
"Once you've been added to the team, you'll see an overview of the "
"available languages. You can see all of them, but can only translate the "
"one whose team you're in."
msgstr "加入团队后，你会看到可用语言的概览。可以查看所有语言，但只能翻译自己所属团队的语言。"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:39
msgid "References and file names"
msgstr "引用和文件名"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:41
msgid ""
"Don't translate names of files or Sphinx references. For example, if you "
"see the string ``:doc:`tutorials` - learning-oriented experiences`` you "
"need to leave ``tutorials`` as it is."
msgstr "不要翻译文件名或 Sphinx 引用。例如，若看到字符串 ``:doc:`tutorials` - learning-oriented experiences``，必须保持 ``tutorials`` 不变。"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:43
msgid ""
"Right now page URLs are *not* being translated, so the French page for "
"*Tutoriels* will be at https://diataxis-"
"translated.readthedocs.io/fr/tutorials/."
msgstr "目前页面 URL *不会* 翻译，因此法语的 *Tutoriels* 页面地址会是 https://diataxis-translated.readthedocs.io/fr/tutorials/。"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:45
msgid ""
"That's not very elegant, but at this stage I don't know if there is an "
"alternative."
msgstr "这并不十分优雅，但现阶段我不知道是否有替代方案。"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:49
msgid "Placeholders"
msgstr "占位符"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:51
msgid ""
"In Transifex you will sometimes see `numbered placeholder symbols "
"<https://help.transifex.com/en/articles/6240403-translating-html-"
"content>`_ for functional Sphinx references. Your translation should "
"include the placeholders too."
msgstr ""
"在 Transifex 中，有时会看到用于功能性 Sphinx 引用的 `带编号占位符 "
"<https://help.transifex.com/en/articles/6240403-translating-html-content>`_。译文中也应保留这些占位符。"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:55
msgid "Translation practice"
msgstr "翻译实践"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:58
msgid "Where to start"
msgstr "从哪里开始"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:60
msgid ""
"**The first page to translate** (Transifex calls pages \"resources) for a"
" new language should be *Start here*. It should also be the first one to "
"refer to if you're contributing to an existing language."
msgstr "新语言 **第一个要翻译的页面** （Transifex 将页面称为“资源”）应是 *从此开始*。为已有语言贡献时，也应优先参照该页面。"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:62
msgid ""
"The reason for that is that it covers the whole of Diátaxis in one page, "
"and gathers together almost all the special terms and forms of words that"
" you will encounter elsewhere. It should be a good guide to translation "
"decisions in general."
msgstr ""
"原因在于，它在一页中涵盖整个 Diátaxis，并汇集了几乎所有会在其他地方遇到的专用"
"术语和词形。它应能为一般的翻译决策提供良好指引。"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:66
msgid "What to aim for"
msgstr "应追求什么"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:68
msgid ""
"I prefer translations to contain good translations for key terms **in "
"their own language**. Even if it's common to use the English term \"how-"
"to\" in your language, I don't want the translations to do that. They "
"should find a native alternative, and use it consistently."
msgstr "我希望译文能用 **目标语言自身** 恰当地翻译关键术语。即使你的语言中常用英文 “how-to”，我也不希望译文这样做；应找到本族语的替代说法，并一致使用。"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:70
msgid ""
"I care much more about **the meaning and force of the ideas** in Diátaxis"
" than the preservation of the way I have expressed them in English. I "
"certainly don't want or expect literal translation. Translations should "
"be idiomatic and sound unforced. Use native sentence structures and "
"constructions. If better metaphors or turns of phrase exist in your "
"language, use those. I'll be happy to discuss those questions."
msgstr "与保留我用英语表达的方式相比，我更在意 Diátaxis 中 **思想的含义和力度**。我当然不想要、也不期待逐字翻译。译文应符合语言习惯、读来不显生硬；请使用本族语的句式和结构。若你的语言中有更好的隐喻或措辞，请用它们。我很乐意讨论这些问题。"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:74
msgid "Be aware of context"
msgstr "注意语境"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:76
msgid ""
"**Take note of the bigger picture.** When you're looking at string by "
"string translations, it's easy to acquire tunnel vision and lose "
"awareness of the context."
msgstr "**留意整体图景。** 逐条查看字符串译文时，很容易产生管中窥豹式的视野，丢失对上下文的意识。"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:80
msgid "Correcting and updating others' translations"
msgstr "修正和更新他人的译文"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:82
msgid ""
"I expect that translation will be collaborative work involving multiple "
"translators, not all of whom might agree on how to translate a particular"
" string."
msgstr "我预计翻译将是一项涉及多位译者的协作工作，未必所有人都会同意某条字符串应如何翻译。"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:84
msgid ""
"If you see something that's clearly wrong (spelling, grammar, "
"punctuation, lost meaning, unidiomatic rendering) correct it."
msgstr "如果看到明显错误（拼写、语法、标点、意思丢失或表达不地道），请修正它。"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:90
msgid ""
"Translation contributions are accepted under the `Creative Commons "
"Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International Public License "
"<https://github.com/evildmp/diataxis-documentation-"
"framework/blob/main/LICENSE.rst>`_."
msgstr ""
"翻译贡献采用 `知识共享 署名-相同方式共享 4.0 国际许可协议 <https://github.com/evildmp/diataxis-documentation-"
"framework/blob/main/LICENSE.rst>`_。"

