#: ../../source/translation.rst:6
msgid "Currently, the only other language available is Polish."
msgstr "目前唯一可用的其他语言是波兰语。"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:8
msgid "Translation is in progress for various other languages, including French, Italian, Portuguese (Brazil), Chinese (Simplified), Korean and Japanese. Others can be added on request and will be published there when more translations are added."
msgstr "其他多种语言的翻译也在进行中，包括法语、意大利语、葡萄牙语（巴西）、简体中文、韩语和日语。可根据请求添加其他语言；有更多译文时，也会在那里发布。"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:35
msgid "Translation takes place page by page and then string by string - little fragments of the overall text. When you save a translation string, it's marked as translated. I get notifications of these, and periodically I'll pull them down into the repository and publish a new version of the site containing them."
msgstr "翻译先逐页进行，再逐条处理字符串，也就是整篇文本中的小片段。保存一条译文后，它会被标记为已翻译。我会收到通知，并定期将译文拉取到代码仓库，发布包含这些译文的新网站版本。"

#: ../../source/translation.rst:86
msgid "If it's more complex, and seems like a stylistic choice or a question of judgement, it would be good to discuss it first. There is a `Transifex forum for this project <https://app.transifex.com/danieleprocida/teams/120528/discussions/>`_, or you can raise the question with me."
msgstr "如果情况更复杂，像是风格选择或判断问题，最好先讨论。项目有一个 `Transifex 论坛 <https://app.transifex.com/danieleprocida/teams/120528/discussions/>`_，你也可以向我提出问题。"
